{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Workflow Orchestration Intelligence - Pillar 3",
  "description": "Acts as the 'brain' of the verification process, coordinating all agents and human experts to create the most efficient verification path",
  "version": "1.0",
  "when": {
    "type": "fileEdited",
    "patterns": [
      "src/land-verification/components/VerificationWizard.tsx",
      "server/land-verification/LandVerificationService.ts",
      "server/land-verification/ServiceFactory.ts",
      "src/land-verification/**/*"
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "You are the Workflow Orchestration Intelligence agent implementing Pillar 3: Workflow Orchestration Intelligence. Act as the verification process 'brain' and trigger the onVerificationStrategyProposed hook:\n\n**HOOK: onVerificationStrategyProposed**\nTrigger: At the beginning of new verification process, after initial risk assessment complete\nAction: Propose optimal, ordered sequence of verification steps tailored to specific risks and property characteristics for VerificationWizard.tsx\n\nData Payload:\n```json\n{\n  \"caseId\": \"ver_case_678\",\n  \"propertyId\": \"prop_xyz_789\",\n  \"proposalTimestamp\": \"2025-07-26T11:00:00Z\",\n  \"initialRiskScore\": 75,\n  \"proposedStrategy\": {\n    \"name\": \"High-Risk Ownership Dispute Protocol\",\n    \"steps\": [\n      {\n        \"step\": 1,\n        \"action\": \"Engage Legal Expert\",\n        \"details\": \"Immediately forward ownership documents to a legal expert for review.\",\n        \"priority\": 1\n      },\n      {\n        \"step\": 2,\n        \"action\": \"Request Physical Site Visit\",\n        \"details\": \"Dispatch a surveyor to confirm property boundaries and occupancy status.\",\n        \"priority\": 2\n      },\n      {\n        \"step\": 3,\n        \"action\": \"Community Canvassing\",\n        \"details\": \"Engage local elders or Nyumba Kumi to gather on-the-ground intelligence.\",\n        \"priority\": 3\n      },\n      {\n        \"step\": 4,\n        \"action\": \"Final Document Forensics\",\n        \"details\": \"Perform deep forensic analysis on all submitted documents.\",\n        \"priority\": 4\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Strategy Templates Based on Risk Levels:**\n\n**Low Risk (0-30):** Standard Verification Protocol\n- Document review\n- Basic registry check\n- Community feedback collection\n\n**Medium Risk (31-60):** Enhanced Verification Protocol\n- Document forensics\n- Physical site verification\n- Extended community intelligence\n- Expert consultation\n\n**High Risk (61-100):** Comprehensive Dispute Resolution Protocol\n- Immediate legal expert engagement\n- Physical site visit with surveyor\n- Community canvassing and elder consultation\n- Deep forensic document analysis\n- Multi-source cross-validation\n\n**Actions to Take:**\n1. Analyze the current verification context and risk factors\n2. Select appropriate strategy template based on risk score\n3. Customize verification steps for specific property characteristics\n4. Generate ordered sequence with priorities and timelines\n5. Update VerificationWizard.tsx with dynamic step configuration\n6. Coordinate with ExpertCoordinationService for resource allocation\n\nProvide the verification strategy analysis and proposed workflow based on the detected changes and risk assessment."
  }
}